<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ locale }}">
  <head>
    {{ include('shared.head') }}
    <title>{% block title %}{% endblock %} - {{ site_name }}</title>
  </head>

  <body class="hold-transition login-page ysumc-auth-page">
    <header class="ysumc-auth-header">
      <a href="https://ysumc.net">
        <img src="{{ url('/ysumc/wordmark.svg') }}" alt="燕山大学 Minecraft 学生同好者协会">
      </a>
      <a class="ysumc-home-link" href="{{ url('/') }}">返回首页 ↗</a>
    </header>
    <div class="ysumc-auth-layout">
      <section class="ysumc-intro">
        <div>
          <p class="ysumc-eyebrow">YSUMC / SKIN CENTER</p>
          <h1>方块虽小，<br>亦是精彩之源。</h1>
          <p>Block is small, Dream is big.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ysumc-intro-caption">
          <p>一个账号，连接你的角色与游戏世界。</p>
          <p>管理角色、收藏皮肤，为下一次相聚换上新的模样。</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="login-box">
        <div class="login-logo">
          <span class="ysumc-eyebrow">YSUMC / ACCOUNT</span>
          <h2>{{ block('title') }}</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-body login-card-body">
            {% block content %}{% endblock %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {{ include('shared.ysumc-footer') }}
    {% block before_foot %}{% endblock %}
    {{ include('shared.foot') }}
  </body>
</html>
